1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,800
AI Background is optional.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,860
It changes

3
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:04,160
the setting around a vehicle

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,440
from your inventory photo.

5
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,050
This is the original

6
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,670
image beside the finished

7
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,130
result for the same vehicle.

8
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,690
To choose a style,

9
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,090
click Configuration

10
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,270
in the left sidebar.

11
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,570
Open Post Style, then

12
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,870
find the background choices.

13
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,440
Select the style

14
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,460
you want to use.

15
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:21,790
Now click Post

16
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,070
to Market in the sidebar.

17
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,660
On the vehicle card,

18
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,200
find AI Background.

19
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,680
First Photo

20
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,850
changes the lead image.

21
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,050
The other options

22
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,690
cover more exterior photos.

23
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,750
Before starting the post,

24
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,050
read the credit cost

25
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:36,190
beside your choice.

26
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,950
Prefer the original photos?

27
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,090
Leave AI Background off.

28
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,470
You'll see the generated

29
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,750
result after posting.

30
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,410
Open the finished Marketplace

31
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:46,030
listing and check that

32
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,230
the image still represents

33
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:48,510
the vehicle accurately.

34
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,250
If something is wrong,

35
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:51,770
have the listing corrected.

36
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:53,420
Dealer-account users

37
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,640
can tell their manager;

38
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,260
individual users can

39
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,900
contact the AutoLander admin.

40
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,690
For this exercise,

41
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:00,950
find the style

42
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:02,350
and First Photo controls

43
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:03,790
without starting a post.

44
00:01:03,910 --> 00:01:05,610
Then compare the original

45
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:07,430
and finished photos shown here.

46
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:08,800
Your workbook has

47
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,970
space to note the option

48
00:01:09,970 --> 00:01:10,990
and its cost.
